From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robin Snyders <robin@snyders.xyz>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 19:15:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: hotdog: enable SuperSpeed and DisplayPort

The port was described as USB 2.0 only: the combo PHY was forced off, the
controller was capped to high speed and given the high-speed PHY alone, and
the USB block was told to take the UTMI clock as its pipe clock, which is
what a board without a SuperSpeed PHY does. A dock therefore enumerated at
high speed and carried no video at all.

The hardware is not USB 2.0 only. usb_1_qmpphy is a combo USB3 and
DisplayPort PHY and the SoC has a DisplayPort controller, both already
described and supplied by the shared SM8150 files; only this board turned
them off.

Stop overriding the PHY off, drop the high-speed cap and the UTMI pipe-clock
workaround so the controller uses both PHYs, enable the DisplayPort
controller on two lanes, and give the connector a DisplayPort altmode.

The connector's port numbering follows the binding: port@0 is the data role,
port@1 is the SuperSpeed and DisplayPort mux on the combo PHY, and port@2 is
the SBU mux. The FSA4480 moves from port@1 to port@2 accordingly, which is
where it belongs once a SuperSpeed mux exists.

Signed-off-by: Robin Snyders <robin@snyders.xyz>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-hotdog.dts | 38 ++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 30 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-hotdog.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-hotdog.dts
@@ -568,22 +568,30 @@
 };
 
 &usb_1 {
-	qcom,select-utmi-as-pipe-clk;
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
 &usb_1_qmpphy {
-	status = "disabled";
+	orientation-switch;
+};
+
+&usb_1_qmpphy_out {
+	remote-endpoint = <&pm8150b_typec_mux_in>;
 };
 
 &usb_1_dwc3 {
 	dr_mode = "otg";
-	maximum-speed = "high-speed";
-	phys = <&usb_1_hsphy>;
-	phy-names = "usb2-phy";
 	usb-role-switch;
 };
 
+&mdss_dp {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&mdss_dp_out {
+	data-lanes = <0 1>;
+};
+
 &usb_1_dwc3_hs {
 	remote-endpoint = <&pm8150b_role_switch_in>;
 };
@@ -615,6 +623,13 @@
 
 		op-sink-microwatt = <10000000>;
 
+		altmodes {
+			displayport {
+				svid = /bits/ 16 <0xff01>;
+				vdo = <0x00001c46>;
+			};
+		};
+
 		ports {
 			#address-cells = <1>;
 			#size-cells = <0>;
@@ -630,6 +645,14 @@
 			port@1 {
 				reg = <1>;
 
+				pm8150b_typec_mux_in: endpoint {
+					remote-endpoint = <&usb_1_qmpphy_out>;
+				};
+			};
+
+			port@2 {
+				reg = <2>;
+
 				pm8150b_sbu_mux_in: endpoint {
 					remote-endpoint = <&fsa4480_sbu_mux>;
 				};
--
2.50.1
